  H["LESSON 1 - THE DICHOTOMY OF CONTROL  (RELEASE CUT)<br/>Coach: LYRA - locked cold-open scene (telescope, dawn)<br/>9:16 vertical - approx 40s - chibi 2.5D - App Store quality<br/>LOCKED production template - this is the prototype for all 19<br/>Palette ONLY black 000000 / signal green 00c896 / off-white eef6f3"]:::brand

  H --> S1
  S1["SHOT 1 - COLD OPEN: LYRA'S MORNING - 0 to 4s<br/>FRAME(Stage): wide. Chibi LYRA at the bronze telescope<br/>on a marble terrace over the Aegean, dawn key light.<br/>She marks star positions on a wax tablet - unaware.<br/>ANIM: 8% slow push-in, idle breathing, light motes drift.<br/>AUDIO: soft sea + dawn birds, no music yet."]:::nova

  S1 --> S2
  S2["SHOT 2 - THE BUZZ - 4 to 7s<br/>FRAME: cut tighter - a modern phone on the marble ledge.<br/>Dark screen -> single green pulse.<br/>CHIBI: head snaps, surprise pop (squash/stretch).<br/>ANIM: phone shudder + 2-ring green glow; light-streak wipe.<br/>AUDIO: ambient ducks; one clean modern buzz (the hook)."]:::shot

  S2 --> S3
  S3["SHOT 3 - THE READ (mono) - 7 to 11s<br/>FRAME: phone fills frame, Lyra's chibi face at edge.<br/>MESSAGE zone, IBM Plex Mono, green on black, types on:<br/>&gt; THETA: you think you control the outcome.<br/>&gt; you don't.<br/>ANIM: per-glyph type-on, cursor blink, screen bloom."]:::nova

  S3 --> S4
  S4["SHOT 4 - QUOTE + OPEN THE PAPER TRADE - 11 to 20s<br/>FRAME: full-frame BLACK app card. Θ mark, then the line<br/>types on (off-white mono). Card transitions into the REAL<br/>paper-trade ENTRY screen; coach PICKS THE UNDERLYING.<br/>Dichotomy baked in: editable=signal-green=yours,<br/>greyed read-only=not yours.<br/>MONO: 'Some things are up to us; some are not. -Epictetus'<br/>-> live entry screen, underlying field green/selected.<br/>VO LYRA: 'It still holds. Watch - I only touch what's mine.'"]:::brand

  S4 --> S5
  S5["SHOT 5 - CONFIRM THE ENTERED TRADE - 20 to 31s<br/>FRAME(Action): the REAL paper-trade CONFIRMATION screen<br/>reading back the exact numbers the coach entered -<br/>underlying / entry / exit / size - in signal-green.<br/>Uncontrollable rows price / earnings / storm = GREYED.<br/>Green-vs-grey ON the real screen IS the lesson.<br/>MONO: green 'underlying·entry·exit·size = <values>'<br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;/ grey 'price · news · storm  —'<br/>VO LYRA: 'I set what I control; the rest just happens.'"]:::shot

  S5 --> S6
  S6["SHOT 6 - SCAN: LIVE CARD (1:1 app UI) - 31 to 36s<br/>FRAME: a real scanner card. Editable = size / entry / exit<br/>(your process, signal green). Read-only + dimmed = price /<br/>news ('not yours'). Defined risk pre-filled.<br/>CHIBI: small approving glance to camera.<br/>DEPENDENCY: this frame == shipping app UI (DESIGN 3b/3c)."]:::spec

  S6 --> S7
  S7["SHOT 7 - COACH LAND + Θ CTA - 36 to 40s<br/>Lyra sets the phone down, returns to the telescope;<br/>camera pulls back - ancient + modern in one frame.<br/>COACH LAND (Lyra, the one line):<br/>'You don't control the price. You control whether<br/>you deserved the trade.'<br/>Θ draws on in green candlesticks. END HOOK:<br/>Θ / don't predict it. trade it. now."]:::brand

  S7 --> F
  F["RELEASE CHECKLIST (sign-off before any credit spend)<br/>[ ] VO script + on-screen mono copy final (above)<br/>[ ] Lyra chibi look locked (Soul character)<br/>[ ] Shot 6 == real app UI confirmed<br/>[ ] Timing 40s, 9:16, palette-only, IBM Plex Mono<br/>This is the prototype; lessons 2-19 swap only shots 4-5 + SCAN."]:::brand

